{"title": "Vampire Bat Form", "pageid": 40485, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Vampire_Bat_Form", "categories": ["Actions", "Class actions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\"><figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Vampire_Bat_Form.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e8/Vampire_Bat_Form.webp/300px-Vampire_Bat_Form.webp, /w/images/e/e8/Vampire_Bat_Form.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e8/Vampire_Bat_Form.webp/300px-Vampire_Bat_Form.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e8/Vampire_Bat_Form.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Vampire Bat Form</b> is a special class action only available to <a href=\"/wiki/Astarion\" title=\"Astarion\">Astarion</a> during the <a href=\"/wiki/Epilogue\" title=\"Epilogue\">Epilogue</a> if he Ascended.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Channel your power as Vampire Ascendant and turn into a vampiric bat. \n</p><p>While in animal shape, you can't talk or cast spells. You take on the attributes of your beast form - excluding your <a href=\"/wiki/Intelligence\" title=\"Intelligence\">Intelligence</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Wisdom\" title=\"Wisdom\">Wisdom</a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/Charisma\" title=\"Charisma\">Charisma</a> scores.\n</p><p>When your beast form drops to 0 <a href=\"/wiki/Hit_points\" title=\"Hit points\">hit points</a>, you revert to your normal form.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<dl class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dt> Cost: </dt>\n<dd> <span class=\"bg3wiki-info-blob\"><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/35px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/46px-Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Action</a></span> </dd>         \n</dl>\n\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Vampire_Bat_Form\">Condition: Vampire Bat Form</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Vampire_Bat_Form_(Condition)\" title=\"Vampire Bat Form (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0c/Vampire_Bat_Form_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Vampire_Bat_Form_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0c/Vampire_Bat_Form_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Vampire_Bat_Form_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0c/Vampire_Bat_Form_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Vampire_Bat_Form_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Vampire Bat Form\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0c/Vampire_Bat_Form_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Vampire_Bat_Form_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0c/Vampire_Bat_Form_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Vampire_Bat_Form_(Condition)\" title=\"Vampire Bat Form (Condition)\">Vampire Bat Form</a></strong>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Polymorphed into a vampire bat</li></ul>\n</div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Creature:_Bat\"> Creature: Bat </span></h3>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div style=\"float: left; margin-bottom: 7px; margin-right: 7px; width: 160px; height: 160px; position: relative\">\n<div style=\"width: 120px; height: 120px; clip-path: circle(60px); position: absolute; top: 50%; left: 50%; transform: translate(-50%, -50%);\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bat\" title=\"Bat\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Portrait_Bat.png/120px-Portrait_Bat.png.webp, /w/images/8/84/Portrait_Bat.png 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Portrait_Bat.png/120px-Portrait_Bat.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/84/Portrait_Bat.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div style=\"width: 160px; height: 160px; position: absolute\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bat\" title=\"Bat\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/14/Portrait_Frame.png/160px-Portrait_Frame.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/14/Portrait_Frame.png/240px-Portrait_Frame.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/14/Portrait_Frame.png/320px-Portrait_Frame.png.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/14/Portrait_Frame.png/160px-Portrait_Frame.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"160\" height=\"160\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/14/Portrait_Frame.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n</div>\n<table class=\"bg3wiki-attrblock-table\"><tbody><tr class=\"bg3wiki-attrblock-score-row\">\n\t\t<td>\n\t\t<p><a href=\"/wiki/Strength\" title=\"Strength\">STR</a></p>\n\t\t<div><b><span>2</span></b></div> <span>(-4)</span>\n</td>\n\n<td>\n\t\t<p><a href=\"/wiki/Dexterity\" title=\"Dexterity\">DEX</a></p>\n\t\t<div><b><span>18</span></b></div> <span>(+4)</span>\n</td